a3958/ss_6cbac73021d68864af20396b919f64e5c26a3958.600x338.jpg?t=1768690221"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804470/0558b5532d5340beaa129bbd8b054baf4ce2ee5b/ss_0558b5532d5340beaa129bbd8b054baf4ce2ee5b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768690221","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804470/0558b5532d5340beaa129bbd8b054baf4ce2ee5b/ss_0558b5532d5340beaa129bbd8b054baf4ce2ee5b.600x338.jpg?t=1768690221"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804470/734939a0ed0e6196a56cce93d0e17c31a95cca1d/ss_734939a0ed0e6196a56cce93d0e17c31a95cca1d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768690221","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804470/734939a0ed0e6196a56cce93d0e17c31a95cca1d/ss_734939a0ed0e6196a56cce93d0e17c31a95cca1d.600x338.jpg?t=1768690221"}],"short_description":"Scour the corrupted Wild West, purifying towns and rescuing them from Death's grasp. Wield unique weapons, gadgets and abilities to grant yourself otherworldly advantages! Injury's an old ally. Fend off haunted hordes while keeping your soul in balance - you're the only guardian left.","steam_appid":3804470,"support_info":{"email":"contact@mindmoss.co.uk","url":"https://mindmoss.co.uk/contact-us"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://mindmoss.co.uk/defiled-west/"}